# Screen objects

- Class suffix `Screen` (not `Page`). Actions are verbs: `enterUsername`, `tapLogin`, `loginAs`. Queries: `isErrorVisible()`.
- Locators: `private static final By LOGIN_BUTTON = AppiumBy.accessibilityId("Login button");`
- Priority: accessibility id → resource-id → UiAutomator → XPath last.
- All taps/types go through `BaseScreen` waits. Implicit wait stays 0. No `Thread.sleep` except the documented RN header long-press reset.
- Public navigation methods return the next screen when the destination is certain (`loginAs` → `CatalogScreen`).
- Log at the action boundary (`log.info("Tapping login")`), not per wait poll.
- Call `ReportManager.logStep(...)` on public actions. Do not assert business outcomes here.
